SUMMARY:GSR Cabin Camping Weekend
LOCATION:Gerber Scout Reservation\, Twin Lake\, Michigan
DESCRIPTION:Michigan Crossroads Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/
 272-CabinCamping27\n\nSnow Sports\, Merit Badge Counselor\n\nJoin the Ger
 ber Scout Reservation Merit Badge Counselors for Innaugural Cabin Camping
  Weekend! This year campers will also be work on the Snow Sports Merit Ba
 dge.\nThis weekend will be very similar to our ever popular Polar Bear ca
 mpout\, with one main exception.  All participants will sleep inside all
  weekend!\nFriday night we will start by completing the indoor parts of t
 he Snow Sports merit badge. On Saturday morning\, participants will head
  outside for the Snow Sports MB\, sledding and winter fun
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/272-CabinCamping27
END:VEVENT
